{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27122","headline":"同徐处士秋怀少室旧居 · 周贺","name":"同徐处士秋怀少室旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾居少室黄河畔，秋梦长悬未得回。\n扶病半年离水石，思归一夜隔风雷。\n荒斋几遇僧眠後，晚菊频经鹿踏来。\n灯下此心谁共说，傍松幽径已多栽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}